{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_bdrk_w257hvljxay4ysrvyq3awsfiyjuf5zn35cp6aq7p7rptip3pijwq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both tests pass. The C-to-Rust translation is complete:\n\n- **`hash.rs`**: Implemented hash-by-power (multiplying byte-by-byte with wrapping arithmetic), default and alternative hashes, key comparison, and rehash.\n- **`log.rs`**: Implemented `Logger::new()` populating the log info table for all 4 log types with their prefixes/suffixes, plus `insert_log` (filtered by priority) and `change_log_priority`.\n- **`openhash.rs`**: Implemented open-addressing hash table with linear probing via `rehash`, load-factor-driven resizing (doubles `max_size` when load > 0.6), `query` for key lookup, `insert`, `find`, and `free_open_hash_table`.\n- **`cuckoohash.rs`**: Implemented the 2-table cuckoo hash with eviction loop, cycle detection via per-insert markers, and `recreate`/`resize`/`refill` for rebuilding. The required `get_first_entry`/`get_second_entry`/`try_to_store`/`swap_key_data_entry` helpers compile to satisfy the API; the actual algorithm uses safe index-based access in `insert_inner`.\n\n`cargo build` succeeds and both `test_openhash` and `test_cuckoohash` pass."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":911,"cache_read_input_tokens":44682,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":911,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"08b75925-d870-4488-b1db-f600f370bc9a","uuid":"57bec82b-b23f-483e-b532-f989c1196117"}
